These are blueprint-style templates for separate Make scenarios.
They are intentionally separate from your daily dashboard scenarios.

Scenario 1: weekly_draft_approval_request.json
- Runs every Sunday morning.
- Calls GitHub Action or HTTP endpoint to generate drafts.
- Sends approval email only to you.

Scenario 2: approval_to_final_send.json
- Starts from a webhook approval button.
- Sends final approved article to final recipients only after approval.

Depending on your Make account/modules, import may require remapping connections.
Use them as safe build templates if import is not accepted.
